Package: lssbi
Architecture: riscv64
Depends:
 lssbi-dkms (= ${source:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: inspect the active RISC-V SBI environment
 lssbi reports the SBI specification and implementation versions, machine
 identifiers, supported SBI extensions, and per-hart firmware features.
 It also provides stable JSON output for machine-readable reports.

Package: lssbi-dkms
Architecture: all
Section: kernel
Depends:
 kmod,
 ${misc:Depends},
Recommends: linux-headers-generic
Description: kernel probe backend for lssbi
 This package provides the DKMS source for the lssbi_probe kernel module.
 The module exposes read-only SBI information to the unprivileged lssbi
 command and is rebuilt automatically when the kernel changes.
